<h1>BuildNow API Documentation</h1>
<p>Submit building permission and application details to the BuildNow system using the Submit Building Details endpoint.</p>
</div>
<section id="endpoint">
<h2>API endpoint</h2>
<p><span class="method">POST</span><span class="endpoint">https://uat-tgrerait.aptonline.in:7443/RERAAPI/api/Buildnow/submitbuildingdetails</span></p>
<table><tbody><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Method</td><td><code>POST</code></td></tr><tr><td>Content-Type</td><td><code>application/json</code></td></tr><tr><td>Endpoint</td><td class="endpoint">https://uat-tgrerait.aptonline.in:7443/RERAAPI/api/Buildnow/submitbuildingdetails</td></tr></tbody></table>
</section>
